sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Author
    participant W as Product workspace
    participant L as Team library
    participant T as Teammate

    A->>W: Validate and submit version
    W-->>A: Diff, permissions, dependencies, tests
    A->>W: Publish approved version
    W->>L: Add immutable release
    T->>L: Discover asset
    L-->>T: Purpose, owner, version, validation, permissions
    T->>W: Install or fork
    W-->>T: Bind local connections and pin version
    A->>W: Publish updated version
    W-->>T: Update available with impact
    T->>W: Review and explicitly update
    W-->>T: New draft, compile and retest required
